    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a2859ca9c0f7ade04745711",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为像我这样一个人是什么也做不了的，\n所以才得去知道更多事、去体验更多事……\n让自己缩短跟其他人的差距才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0515d888a98e3eb901401a5b5bc7718f4d5d88b4090e1d0ba75c86df10c720f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1019/storytimeline_501019114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
