      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛没有一丝犹豫地断言道。\n爱丽数码看着她的那副模样──\n眼里闪烁着我从未看过的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "979d900c9aed76ddd99923256ea7b279e96def10230f931de14675fc61e9866a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
